.Nd OpenSSL application commands
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm openssl
.Em cmd
.Fl help
|
.Oo
.Em -option
|
.Em -option
.Em arg ]
\&...
.Oo
.Em arg ]
\&...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
Every
.Em cmd
listed above is a (sub-)command of the
.Xr openssl 1
application.
It has its own detailed manual page at
.Sy openssl- Ns Em cmd Ns (1).
For example, to view the manual page for the
.Sy openssl dgst
command, type
.Qo Li man openssl-dgst Qc .
.Sh OPTIONS
Among others, every subcommand has a help option.
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Sy -help
Print out a usage message for the subcommand.
